            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa41824"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Nze, Yuda, omuddu wa Yesu Kristo, era muganda wa Yakobo, mpandiikira abaagalwa bonna abaayitibwa mu Katonda Kitaffe, era abakuumibwa Yesu Kristo.",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:1",
        "verseNumber": "1",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JUD/JUD.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121d807e4909dcafe0ae00",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.10",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa418b8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa41824"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Naye kale abantu bano bavvoola kye batategeera, era okufaanana ng’ensolo obusolo bakola buli kye baagala, era ebyo bibaleetedde okuzikirira.",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:10",
        "verseNumber": "10",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JUD/JUD.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121d807e4909dcafe0ae7c",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.11",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa418b8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa41824"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Zibasanze abo! Kubanga bagoberera ekkubo lya Kayini, era bakola buli kye basobola okufunamu ensimbi okufaanana nga Balamu, era ne bajeemera Katonda nga Koola bwe yakola, noolwekyo balizikirizibwa.",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:11",
        "verseNumber": "11",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JUD/JUD.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121d807e4909dcafe0aeb6",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.12",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa418b8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa41824"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Abantu bano bwe bajja ne babeegattamu nga muli ku mbaga zammwe ez’okumanyagana, baba ng’amabala amabi, nga tebatya, nga beefaako bokka, nga bali ng’ebire ebitaliimu mazzi ebitwalibwa empewo; oba ng’emiti egiwaatudde, egitaliiko bibala, egyafa emirundi ebiri, egyakuulibwa n’emirandira;",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:12",
        "verseNumber": "12",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JUD/JUD.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121d807e4909dcafe0aee6",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.13",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa418b8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa41824"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "oba ng’amayengo ag’oku nnyanja agasiikuuse, ebikolwa byabwe ne bibaswaza; oba ng’emmunyeenye eziva mu kkubo lyazo, eziterekeddwa ekizikiza ekikutte ennyo eky’olubeerera.",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:13",
        "verseNumber": "13",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JUD/JUD.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121d807e4909dcafe0af32",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.14",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa418b8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa41824"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Enoka eyaliwo nga wayiseewo emirembe musanvu okuva ku Adamu, abantu bano yaboogerako eby’obunnabbi nti, “Mulabe Mukama ajja n’abatukuvu be abangi ennyo.",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:14",
        "verseNumber": "14",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JUD/JUD.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121d807e4909dcafe0af91",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.15",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa418b8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa41824"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Alireeta abantu bonna mu maaso ge basalirwe omusango mu bwenkanya olw’ebikolwa byabwe bonna abatatya Katonda, bye baakola mu bugenderevu, n’olw’ebigambo byonna ebizibu abakozi b’ebibi bye bamwogeddeko eby’obutatya Katonda.”",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:15",
        "verseNumber": "15",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JUD/JUD.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121d807e4909dcafe0afc3",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.16",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa418b8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa41824"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Beemulugunya, era bakola buli kye beegomba, era nga boogerera waggulu ebigambo eby’okweraga; era olaba bassizzaamu omuntu ekitiibwa ng’omanya nti balina kye bamwagalako.",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:16",
        "verseNumber": "16",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JUD/JUD.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121d807e4909dcafe0b020",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.17",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa418b8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa41824"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Naye mmwe, abaagalwa, mujjukire abatume ba Mukama waffe Yesu Kristo ebigambo bye baayogera edda",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:17",
        "verseNumber": "17",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JUD/JUD.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121d817e4909dcafe0b034",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.18",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa418b8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa41824"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "bwe baabagamba nti, “Mu nnaku ez’oluvannyuma walijjawo abantu abalibasekerera, nga beegomba nga bwe baagala, nga batambulira mu bitasiimibwa Katonda.”",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:18",
        "verseNumber": "18",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JUD/JUD.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121d817e4909dcafe0b07b",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.19",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa418b8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa41824"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Abo be bo abaleeta enjawukana, ab’omubiri obubiri era abatalina Mwoyo Mutukuvu.",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:19",
        "verseNumber": "19",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JUD/JUD.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121d7f7e4909dcafe0ab67",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.2",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa418b8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa41824"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Ekisa kya Katonda, n’emirembe, n’okwagala byeyongerenga mu mmwe.",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:2",
        "verseNumber": "2",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JUD/JUD.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121d817e4909dcafe0b0b7",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.20",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa418b8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa41824"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Naye mmwe, abaagalwa, musaana okuzimba obulamu bwammwe nga bweyongera okuba obw’amaanyi, nga mubuzimbira ku musingi ogw’okukkiriza kwammwe okutukuvu, era nga musaba mu Mwoyo Mutukuvu,",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:20",
        "verseNumber": "20",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JUD/JUD.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121d817e4909dcafe0b0dd",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.21",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa418b8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa41824"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "nga mwekuumira mu kwagala kwa Katonda, nga mwesunga okusaasira kwa Mukama waffe Yesu Kristo olw’obulamu obutaggwaawo.",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:21",
        "verseNumber": "21",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JUD/JUD.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121d817e4909dcafe0b133",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.22",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa418b8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa41824"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Mubeerenga ba kisa eri abo ababuusabuusa mu kukkiriza,",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:22",
        "verseNumber": "22",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JUD/JUD.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121d817e4909dcafe0b19d",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.23",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa418b8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa41824"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "n’abalala mufubenga okubawonya nga mubakwakkula mu nnimi z’omuliro, n’abalala mubatuuse eri Mukama nga muyita mu kubalaga ekisa ng’aboonoonyi, wabula mukyawe ekyambalo, ekijjudde amabala agakiteekeddwako omubiri gwabwe.",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:23",
        "verseNumber": "23",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JUD/JUD.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121d817e4909dcafe0b206",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.24",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa418b8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa41824"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Katonda asobola okubawanirira muleme okuva mu kkubo lye, era n’okubatuusa mu maaso ge ag’ekitiibwa nga temuliiko kamogo era nga mujjudde essanyu;",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:24",
        "verseNumber": "24",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JUD/JUD.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121d817e4909dcafe0b26c",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.25",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa418b8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa41824"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Katonda oyo omu yekka atulokola okuyita mu Yesu Kristo Mukama waffe, agulumizibwe era atenderezebwenga olw’amaanyi ge n’obuyinza bwe, okuva ku mirembe gyonna egyayita, ne kaakano era ne mu mirembe egitaliggwaawo! Amiina.",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:25",
        "verseNumber": "25",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JUD/JUD.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121d7f7e4909dcafe0ab9b",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.3",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa418b8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa41824"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Abaagalwa, nnali neesunga nnyo okubawandiikira ku bulokozi bwaffe bwe ntyo nawalirizibwa okubawandiikira nga mbazzaamu amaanyi nga mbegayirira mulwanirire okukkiriza abatukuvu kwe baaweebwa omulundi ogumu.",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:3",
        "verseNumber": "3",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JUD/JUD.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121d807e4909dcafe0abf1",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.4",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa418b8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa41824"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Waliwo abantu abajja mu bubba, abaawandiikwako edda nga baasalirwa omusango, abatatya Katonda abajerega ekisa kya Katonda waffe, ne bakiyisaamu amaaso, ne beegaana Yesu Kristo Mukama waffe, omu yekka.",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:4",
        "verseNumber": "4",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JUD/JUD.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121d807e4909dcafe0ac47",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.5",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa418b8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e3fc35ce9345aa41824"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Naye njagala okubajjukiza nti newaakubadde nga byonna mubimanyi, nga olunaku lumu Mukama yalokola eggwanga n’aliggya mu nsi y’e Misiri, oluvannyuma n’azikiriza abatakkiriza,",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:5",
